Z||000005||Oreif||11-04-2001||01:09 AM||||The guy that own's the company is Archie. He even has body kits for Fiero's too. At the last few gatherings our local club has had, Archie gave rides in one of his cars. 0 to 100 then back to 0. He was NOT easy on the car and it's using stock trans and axles. He hasn't broken it yet!<BR>If you are curious, just go with your friend and get a tour of his place.||||reg||1
