Z||000015||88CoupeV6||11-04-2001||11:42 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by '75 383 vette:<BR><B>BUT if yer just gonna put a big 'ol cessna wing on the back, with a big 'ol fart tube chrome exhaust tip, and all kind of graphics on the car (like you've got corporate sponsership) AND THE THING IS STILL SLOW...<BR>YER JUST A POSUER!!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I think you will find that us Fiero owners or most American car owners feel the same way about that rice stuff  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> You will not find fart can exhaust on Fieros.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
